/- Remark 13.36.7: any retract-stable triangulated object property containing `E` contains the
generated thick subcategory `⟨E⟩`. This is exactly
`objectGeneratedProperty_le_of_mem`. -/
recall objectGeneratedProperty_le_of_mem

